 endgame and if you search on  imdb  and other movie credit sites he is  nowhere to be found  so that points to this showing up on  google search  simply because people are searching for  it so if you hear other people say it's  confirmed hugh jackman will be in  avengers in-game as wolverine  it's not sadly but could it happen yes  it could the disney fox deal is just  about done it is set to be wrapped up in  january  and the deal is so close to being done  that people at marvel are actually  beginning to talk about the x-men and  the fantastic four being in the mcu  and i've stated this in a few videos  actually just because disney and marvel  don't own the rights to use a character  doesn't mean  that they can't work out a deal to be  able to use that character they've  actually done this before they did a  deal for deadpool and guardians of the  galaxy vol 2.  fox allowed disney and marvel to use ego  and disney and marvel allowed fox to use  negasonic teenage warhead and also  change her powers  so could a deal have been worked out to  be able to use wolverine in avengers end  game  yes absolutely especially since he's  coming home to marvel so soon anyways  but this is just speculation this is in  no way  a confirmation but people are asking if  it's even possible  yes it is possible however unlikely it  is it is still possible and then people  were asking me  why they would do this is this their way  to introduce x-men into the mcu do it in  avengers end game  i don't think that's their mindset kevin  feige has already said that he wouldn't  want to introduce wolverine first into  the mcu he actually stated that he would  like to do the fantastic four  first so i don't think it would be for a  sole purpose to introduce  mutants into the mcu going forward but i  think it would be more along the lines  that  wolverine is actually in the infinity  gauntlet series in the comics  in the comics there are many x-men going  against thanos with the avengers  in fact 