e  again the google search doesn't confirm  anything and i actually think that  google will eventually realize it's  there and take it down  and although the russo brothers and  kevin feige have said that we're going  to see some new characters in avengers  in-game i don't think it would be such a  huge character as wolverine  since end game is wrapping up the first  10 years of the mcu  they're going to want to keep the focus  on the heroes that we love  and although i know everyone would love  to see wolverine in avengers in game i  think it would take too much away from  our current heroes  and if some of them are going to die or  retire i think we should give them  the full respect they deserve so this is  why everybody is freaking out right now  talking about wolverine being  in avengers endgame you can go to google  and do that search yourself but let me  know what you think about this  do you think hugh jackman is going to be  in avengers end game as wolverine or do  you not think so  let me know your thoughts in the  comments down below and again very last  day to enter the infinity gauntlet  giveaway all you have to do to enter for  your chance to win is subscribe to my  channel  like this video and comment down below  with your thoughts and your favorite  superhero  again happy new year's eve and as always  thank you so much for watching  wolf wolf  [Music]  you
 

